  "bio": "Welcome to RedINC Tattoo & Body Piercing, Luton’s premier ink sanctuary where the vibrancy of traditional art meets the precision of dotwork. Our renowned resident artists, including the likes of @lamat_tattoo and @stephanie.dots_, are committed to crafting bespoke body art in a creatively charged, yet cozy environment. Drop us a DM to turn your vision into a masterpiece at the heart of the UK.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Luton, England, United Kingdom"
